<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>CSS Grid Cards</title>
<style>
:root{
--primary:teal;
--accent:#14b8a6;
--bg:#f0fdfa;
--card:#ffffff;
--text:#134e4a;
--radius:12px;
--space:20px;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
body{
margin:0;
padding:var(--space);
background:var(--bg);
color:var(--text);
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
}
.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:1fr;
gap:var(--space);
}
.card{
position:relative;
background:var(--card);
border:2px solid var(--primary);
border-radius:var(--radius);
padding:40px var(--space) var(--space);
transition:transform .3s ease,box-shadow .3s ease;
}
.card::before{
content:"✨";
position:absolute;
top:15px;
left:20px;
font-size:24px;
}
.card:hover{
transform:translateY(-6px);
box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(0,128,128,.3);
}
@media (min-width:640px){
.grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);}
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
:root{
--primary:#5eead4;
--accent:#2dd4bf;
--bg:#0f2927;
--card:#163b38;
--text:#ccfbf1;
}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>My Skills</h1>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card"><h2>💻 Programming</h2><p>I enjoy learning programming and building projects.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h2>🎮 Gaming</h2><p>Gaming is one of my favourite hobbies.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h2>🎨 Creativity</h2><p>I like creating new ideas and designs.</p></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
